00:56:58,610 --> 00:57:01,070
Now, what we would do
at this case, which

1228
00:57:01,070 --> 00:57:03,837
is pretty interesting, is so
this would deterministically--

1229
00:57:03,837 --> 00:57:05,670
I would put down, say,
a piece on the board.

