00:57:05,670 --> 00:57:10,740
In this case, I decided
to put down this piece.

1231
00:57:10,740 --> 00:57:14,960
And then what I would do is
I would flip over and pretend

1232
00:57:14,960 --> 00:57:19,310
to be the opponent and it would
do the same thing using its Q

1233
00:57:19,310 --> 00:57:22,910
and U. Now it's
Q and U are going

1234
00:57:22,910 --> 00:57:25,490
to use the same neural
network approximation.

1235
00:57:25,490 --> 00:57:27,630
So this is just self-play.

1236
00:57:27,630 --> 00:57:29,450
But it's just useful
to in this case

1237
00:57:29,450 --> 00:57:31,743
that they are going to be
optimizing for the opposite.

1238
00:57:31,743 --> 00:57:33,410
One is trying to
optimize that the Black

1239
00:57:33,410 --> 00:57:34,500
pieces are going to dominate.

1240
00:57:34,500 --> 00:57:35,700
The other one is going
to try to optimize

1241
00:57:35,700 --> 00:57:36,990
so the white pieces dominate.

1242
00:57:36,990 --> 00:57:47,650
So now we're going to have that
